    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoashi sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba ispwa bea sugoocheanduumeeda Yehu, hean ghoang'eat Yoashi sugoocheanduumeeda ak ghwaak gweanyeew haradam aba Yerusalemu. Ak gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Sibiya bea Beer-sheba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoashi gwasin gea miyaasiin aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, aba eawoojigaaschi sean aba gideaba niny ghoanaal Yehoyada was ashoohoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak heetiyeada sibadiini ghadooweeda ea miyeenyarja inyeesa gaweay buuneeda eatayda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda. Ea haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda nea geejooysa geeta siing'andiita heetiyeada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Yoashi ak gwayeesha ashoohoodiga, “Lapiyeeda sean bea haleanjeeda ghaydit bea gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ea lapiyeeda jea eegadiyeata, ea lapiyeeda buuneeda deena gidasing'oorsiinda giliwas sih, ea lapiyeeda sean siyeadu bea gidagasiida siida aba gurooroadaanyi gweadu gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghoang'waay ashoohoodiga lapiya aba heeda buuneeda amwahit lapiyeedida iimida heeda nyaraat bea gheeda sibata ASEETA gajeesna.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu geeyi bwak ea gawa gweaydeaba diktam ea samwagu bea sugoocheanduumeeda Yoashi, nea ashoohoodiga ea miighwadeas heeda nyaraat bea gheedean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaguursa Yoashi Yehoyada was ashoohoocheanda ea ashoohoodiga suuk, ak ghoanyaash nea gwayeesha, “Ghwasaan anda mii adeasa heeda nyaraat bea gheedean? Asi ghang'eada ghamneawa adagudoasachi lapiyeeda buuneeda, ayeani eadeasana heeda nyaraat bea gheeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamwas ashoohoodiga gideaba mayghoang'waay lapiyeeda buuneeda, ea gideaba mwayghwadeas heeda nyaraat bea gheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gageanu Yehoyada was ashoohoocheanda, sandakwajeanda ak ghwasaaw ghuut amwahit ghwayiin murdeeda heeda wagiida bea geatinda dugwa aba gideaba iihidu buuneeda jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea ashoohoodiga fur gidaghuuta ghwayiin lapiyeeda sean siyeadu jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea geadaah gideaba lapiya aasaang'a aba jeeda sandakwajeanda. Hean gawa ng'oorshoocheanda sugoocheanda ea ashoohoocheanda haw gwadiyeada, ak geepis sandakwajeanda ak geeyiida lapiyeeda mida jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata nea siihiit iitooda lapiya, hean geataw fugiga bea gadiyeeda miineadaysa fuga gadiiyi bea gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ak ghoadaw fugiga fuga gadiiyi was gearnoodi ea fuga deas gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea deekshoodiga ea fuga beara lagheanga nea suuk geashaaha geediga ea lagheanga sishit, jea eadeasa heeda nyar bea gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea gidawas sean sigasa jea eadeasa gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gheawi bea NG'UTAMIIDEAN ea meesinana giihearmajeega sisna lapiya, ghana gujaka ghana gweerajeega, ghana durumbeatajeega, ghana haleanjeeda wassean sisna dahaabu siguura dahaabu ghana haleanjeeda sisna lapiya aba lapiyeeni siyeadu gheeda NG'UTAMIIDEAN. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba lapiya geataw fuga gadiyeeda ak ghwadeas gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak fugiga siitaw lapiyeeda jea ghoadaw fugiga bea gadiyeedean, gwasin gadiyeeda aba doobiiwnata eara lapiya ea miyeeyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea lapiyeeda siitayda bea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea giidiinyeanda ea lapiyeeda haleanjeeda sisapa geadi aba riing'eeda; ea meeyeana gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA suh gea ashoohoodiga gil gabeachi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'at Hasaeli was sugoocheanda Shaamu ak ghwascheang'da ak gang'uchi sea Gati ak ghwajoar. Ng'ata ghwascheang'da Hasaeli gawa Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanda Yoashi was sugoocheanda Yuda haleanjeeda sean ghayi ea ghaydit Yehoshafati ea Yehoramu ea Ahasiya was ghweaniga nyaawa was sugoodiga Yuda ea gea ea ghaydit niny, ea dahaabu siguura dahaabu sean mida heeda siitiiwiisa haleanjeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. Ea gheeda sugoocheanda ak gweasa Hasaeli was sugoocheanda Yuda, ak ghang'eada Yerusalemu ak gawa heechea gawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ng'asheega sean sin Yoashi miyeeng'oorsa jeeda gitaabooda damanyoojiga bea sugoodiga Yuda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda ak ghang'ut foolayda, ak geenuus Yoashi aba gheeh Milo mida rarang'eadayda Sila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga bwar ea geaba Yosakari gil was orjeeda Shimeati, ea Yehosabadi was orjeeda Shomeri, was fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda. Geabwar ama meah geebung'sa heeda ghweanigaaschi aba mujiineeda Dawdi. Ak gawa hoorgeadaanyi bea sugoocheanduumeeda orjeedaanyi was Amasiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
